OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain, mostly in the west. This
OL,7,Fwill clear for a time during the
OL,8,Fafternoon and become light and patchy
OL,9,Ftowards the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPatchy rain in the west at
OL,12,Ffirst otherwise dry with clear spells
OL,13,Fin the east. Cloud will spread east
OL,14,Ffrom after midnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FBright spells and mostly dry
OL,17,Fin the morning. Cloud and rain, some
OL,18,Fheavy, spread south in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
